<title>USA: Haverty June same-store sales flat.</title>
<headline>Haverty June same-store sales flat.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Haverty Furniture Cos Inc said Tuesday its total June sales increased 6.3 percent, to $36.5 million from $34.3 million a year ago. Comparable-store sales were flat, it said, with a 0.1 percent increase recorded.</p>
<p>Total sales for the 1997 first half were $227.8 million, up 6.4 percent from $214.1 million a year earlier. Comparable-store sales were down 0.4 percent.</p>
</text>
